[{"id":2556745274,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YZNY6","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This actually struck me as a feature that was missing in the original spring bone, since I wanted to use it to implement wind... so I am happy to see this added as a feature.\r\n\r\n> Maybe we could also add a randomizer to set random force for each joint (like fractal field) but we should do that in another PR or proposal as a follow up, since we need to be careful how we define the parameters\r\n\r\nI think this is a bit overkill. I'd rather see people who need this can add randomness to the per-joint gravity in a script, and if it affects people who need better performance, then we can add randomness to the engine in a future version. I just don't think we're going to guess exactly what users need in advance.\r\n\r\nIs the unit of m/s correct? It should probably match gravity. Is there an overall gravity strength setting?","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101633#pullrequestreview-2556745274","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101633","author